# Tam, Mindful First-Year (a 2/2): "Each other creature you control has hexproof from each of its colors." and "{T}: Target
# creature you control becomes all colors until end of turn." Turn 1 Bot1 casts Elvish Mystic (green) and Tam. Turn 2 Bot2's
# green Giant Growth can't target the Mystic (hexproof from green, from an opponent's source) but can target Tam itself, which the
# static says nothing of. Turn 3 Tam taps to make the Mystic all colors: Bot2's red Lightning Bolt can't target it either
# that turn, and on turn 4, the effect over, the Mystic is green alone and the Bolt kills it.

